# Intentionally defines no variables.
#
# gate-cli.test.ts spawns the real entrypoint with `--env-file` pointed here.
# Without it, bun auto-loads the repo-root `.env` into the spawned process,
# re-injecting the POSTHOG_* credentials the test just scrubbed from its own
# environment — so the credential-gate tests would pass only on a machine with
# no `.env` (CI) and fail for any developer who has configured a test project.
